Data Licences:

Macroeconomic data (GDP.csv, 10-Year Interest Rate.csv, Unemployment Rate.csv):
Sourced from Federal Reserve Economic Data (FRED), Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis.
Public domain — freely redistributable.
Source: https://fred.stlouisfed.org

Stock data (Data/*.csv):
Sourced from IEX Exchange / Yahoo Finance for educational and portfolio demonstration
purposes. Not for commercial redistribution. Use scripts/fetch_djia_data.py to
download fresh data directly from Yahoo Finance via the yfinance library.
